{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_203_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_203_gc_01_title", "source_sha256": "12f0fa1e9316e490647297041e92aebbd30e8a9b893059dabc445c3263bd6503", "ja": "「VOY@GER」SPコミュ", "zh": "“VOY@GER”SP交流", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_203_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_203_gc_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a7a0c0b82b515c4452535729a6793f41678298545693b089429d8054a9d7355c", "ja": "事務所をまたいだ特別な合同\nステージへ臨む杏奈、海美、紬。\nプレッシャーも輝きに変えて進む、\nアイドルたちの一幕です。", "zh": "杏奈、海美和紬即将登上跨事务所的特别联合舞台。  \n这是偶像们将压力也化作光芒、勇往直前的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_203_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_203_gc_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a9bd014f91fbb09ee7d3d65192589bc9c9ab8c4bcd6566accbb878d561efc94a", "ja": "（事務所の垣根を超えた、合同企画が開催中！\n多くのアイドル達が共演する、夢の一大イベントだ）", "zh": "（跨越事务所界限的联合企划正在举办中！\n这是众多偶像同台演出的梦幻大型活动。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_203_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_203_gc_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "da9a0693d99f546e0331090c6aad4076644d17777e352c3d14b108a5a27c0957", "ja": "（先行公開中のスペシャルムービーにも使われた、\n特別楽曲……今日はそのライブがある！）", "zh": "（特别歌曲……也被用于正在先行公开的特别影片中，\n今天终于要举行这首歌的演唱会了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_203_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_203_gc_01_1002_audience", "source_sha256": "50bdd44168973a204885bf4263895827dfe45dcbd9b1a60de4f81bfe559967d5", "ja": "ワアアアーーーーッ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊————！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_203_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_203_gc_01_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "49b521d02a3757fd57da81b5b2c91210268611f3c5779de08a0394ba2760a10e", "ja": "さすがに、すごい熱気ですね……うぅ。\n少しはライブにも慣れましたが、この規模は……。", "zh": "不愧是大型演出，气氛真是热烈得惊人……呜呜。  \n虽然我已经稍微习惯现场演出了，但这种规模还是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_203_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_203_gc_01_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "9de4e69b3eda6dbea4c6d57df26946cf66bda41683fa033ded1930c8dd3ecd8b", "ja": "特別な日、だから……もし、杏奈たちが失敗したら、\nみんなすっごく……がっかりする、よね……。", "zh": "因为是特别的日子……所以，要是杏奈她们失败了，大家一定会……非常失望的，对吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_203_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_203_gc_01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "150e80080808b536ef3d679aaf074213a8ed882d959a5ae586bc0c3d05d1f9c2", "ja": "紬、杏奈？　なんだか弱気になっちゃってるな。\n失敗なんて気にせず、堂々とやろう！", "zh": "紬、杏奈？感觉你们有点泄气了啊。别在意失败，大大方方地去做吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_203_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_203_gc_01_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5d81b20ea411996ed8d34e95e5f7e110da360c2ea76b3ce53386fe6a615f06e1", "ja": "またそんな、無責任なことを……！　今日が\nどれほど大切なステージか、覚えていないのですか？", "zh": "又说这种不负责任的话……！您难道\n不记得今天的舞台有多重要了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_203_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_203_gc_01_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c1038abeba09914f40d70b11df4df1e6022259877df3f9baded7ffc36c1fdab4", "ja": "他の事務所のファンの皆様も、注目してくださって\nいるのに……無様なところは見せられません。", "zh": "其他事务所的各位粉丝也都在关注着我们……不能让他们看到我们狼狈的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_203_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_203_gc_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "623f330a8d5ceaf9813b34075fbe49d81ee5f4e848f50b34d4a32605e1e16869", "ja": "確かに大きなイベントだけど、ここまで来たら、\nもうドーンと構えておくしかないと思うよ。", "zh": "确实是个大活动，但都走到这一步了，\n只能放开心态、大胆迎上去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_203_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_203_gc_01_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "be89047dbae0201b64be8f354e41dd476e5d82da46c42700f4986f0b7465f8dc", "ja": "ん……それはそう、だけど……。", "zh": "嗯……确实是这样，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_203_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_203_gc_01_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "946056ed7a61d44ad1fd46fc8c50bcef67986d9fb4bbcc799b1a473d54cc49fc", "ja": "ふたりとも！　そんなカチンコチンになること\nないってー！　ほら、楽しも！　ね～☆", "zh": "你们两个！没必要都这么紧绷啦——！来，开心点吧！好不好～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_203_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_203_gc_01_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "d3617f700d1e9f8c5b7c744368fd2a83723f36729b7f3d93878ee76f77b7f7b0", "ja": "海美さんは、いつも通り、だね……えへへ。\n杏奈も、見習わないと……すぅ、はぁ……。", "zh": "海美前辈还是一如既往呢……嘿嘿。\n杏奈也得向她学习才行……呼——吸——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_203_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_203_gc_01_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "08ebed095f11912192f1a44f6e30ddc8f907b5e005c029230e61586c149688a1", "ja": "イェーイ！　杏奈、ビビッとスイッチオン♪\n新しい未来に向けて、ログイン準備完了ですっ☆", "zh": "耶——！杏奈，活力开关开启♪\n面向崭新的未来，登录准备完毕☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_203_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_203_gc_01_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "fa0592e100ff36c0d5fd23573b4a1e4025e18fef9781a2913c43429faa8cf3e4", "ja": "あっ、望月さんが、テンションMAXに……！\nうちだけ残されて……ううっ。", "zh": "啊，望月同学情绪完全调动起来了……！\n只留我一个人在这……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_203_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_203_gc_01_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e4ab51da06b954d0050cb64b8f22c8a04217f58cb46206ed519302b693dd9916", "ja": "ほら、紬も。責任感も大切だけど、\n今日はお祝いだ。楽しむしかないだろう？", "zh": "来吧，紬也是。责任感固然重要，但今天可是庆祝会。只能尽情享受了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_203_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_203_gc_01_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "35ea9130615a170d90275c43551c2c0a2550904cbda1d5a855a7d3e22a5b66fa", "ja": "わ、わかっています。せっかくのお祝いの席ですし、\n私も、笑顔で……え、笑顔で……。", "zh": "我、我知道。难得是庆祝的场合，\n我也要面带笑容……诶，笑容……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_203_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_203_gc_01_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "f9649585373491e6b88f3ccac4256dcf62170c06669db6c7c903e8f8b3aeb9c6", "ja": "んー……つむりん。無理に笑顔をつくんなくても\nいいんじゃないかな？　とか言っちゃったり！", "zh": "唔——……紬紬。我觉得就算不勉强自己笑出来也没关系吧？　开玩笑的啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_203_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_203_gc_01_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4335d67e69581c5b712a323b62126ac45d841f5806babf001cd802a3635c7345", "ja": "高坂さん、しかし……笑顔はアイドルの基本では？\n強張った表情のまま、ステージに上がるわけには……。", "zh": "高坂小姐，可是……笑容不是偶像的基本吗？总不能就保持着僵硬的表情登上舞台……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_203_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_203_gc_01_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "99fe16146b5dc544af974dbc73d8715cd08a5055e96305bb7833bf446133c1a1", "ja": "ほら、今日の歌にもあるでしょ？\nドキドキする気持ちは、エネルギーになるから！", "zh": "你看，今天的歌里也有吧？\n因为心里怦怦直跳的感觉，会化作力量！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_203_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_203_gc_01_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "771eee13e09def14e3a5cdae546ce03bd6054f820afe15a991be586a57798112", "ja": "だからつむりんも、そのままで……。\nドキドキする気持ちのままで、いいんじゃないかな？", "zh": "所以紬也，就保持现在这样……  \n保持着这份心跳不已的心情，不也挺好的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_203_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_203_gc_01_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "4130a2170f1b42b1118cc56c47376ac7a7d7742b43a719dfb6d9f074101364c9", "ja": "そうそう！　これまでの杏奈たちを、\n胸を張って見てもらおうよ。たくさんの人たちに！", "zh": "对对！让大家都骄傲地看看至今为止的杏奈她们吧，给更多的人看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_203_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_203_gc_01_1021_051tmg", "source_sha256": "244535e581642690a6691148700fe025531f346e395399b46e54a9b228eef161", "ja": "これまでの、私たちを……胸を張って……。", "zh": "让大家……堂堂正正地看看至今为止的我们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_203_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_203_gc_01_1022_024ann", "source_sha256": "801132018f1b6c3d82338a366fa338e88ac34c995e37374fb970f35edeb75d79", "ja": "大丈夫！　杏奈たち、たくさん練習してきたんだもん！\n後は楽しむだけ！　でしょ？", "zh": "没问题！毕竟杏奈我们，已经做了那么多练习嘛！\n接下来只要享受舞台就好了！对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_203_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_203_gc_01_1023_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0dc6305ed4bd8123a869bee511bd5cdaeed6fd1b64292e100909bd2c1733ec44", "ja": "ふふ……そうですね。私もやっと、準備ができました。\nありのままの私を、見て頂く覚悟が。", "zh": "呵呵……是啊。我也终于准备好了。\n也做好了让您看到真实的我的觉悟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_203_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_203_gc_01_1024_051tmg", "source_sha256": "45875baf6851eba9437d1608ff6c15aee74911269bdb9710d7b8f8958f598b1d", "ja": "お見せしましょう。私たちの、これまでの軌跡……。\nそして、未来へと続く軌跡を。", "zh": "就让您看看吧。我们一路走来的轨迹……以及通向未来的轨迹。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_203_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_203_gc_01_1025_029umi", "source_sha256": "8c8619de9eb3cc0066f6a88213d6fa09e347d7fc5e477040ee71507a00e83f6d", "ja": "うんうん！　それじゃあ{$P$}、\n行ってくるね☆　みんなと、未来を作りに！", "zh": "嗯嗯！那我就和{$P$}一起，出发啦☆去和大家一起创造未来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_203_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_203_gc_01_1026_p", "source_sha256": "fa66cc141707f69e200ac33bae4caa44d8c4daf764ca9dd4e46ce1ad92e919dc", "ja": "（そうしてステージに飛び出していった3人の背中\nは、いつもよりたくましく見えた）", "zh": "（就这样，3人飞奔上舞台的背影，看起来比平时更加坚强可靠。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_203_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_203_gc_01_1027_p", "source_sha256": "cbfcddbeaa4f7d9f2d144216934c046b8449561b53ea00ac1bf4317af14c716e", "ja": "（今までの輝きを燃料に、未知の未来へ……。\nみんなのこと、しっかり支え続けていかないとな！）", "zh": "（以至今为止的光辉为燃料，向着未知的未来……我一定要继续好好支持大家才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
